title: "GitHub Repository for the DSADC1 digital back-end chip on the ihp-sg13cmos5l Open-PDK."
abstract: "Tapeout repository of the DSADC1 digital back end on IHP SG13CMOS5L: a 1.6 mm die in QFN32 carrying one macro with the 128x decimation filter, an SPI slave and the configuration register file, hardened with LibreLane on the EZ130 8T standard cells."
keywords:
  - IHP SG13CMOS5L
  - delta-sigma ADC
  - decimation filter
  - open-source silicon
  - LibreLane
